    "detailed_description": "Inspired by games like Persona 4, Higurashi, and Doki Doki Literature Club, Siren\u2019s Call: Escape Velocity is a tropical cocktail of delicious summertime dread. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952590/extras/5e41f9fe74d82d970bedae120a762883.avif?t=1727853397\" width=496 height=191 /></span><br><br><strong><u>As a story that begins at the end, all that's standing between you and adulthood are your old party members. Your best friends.</u></strong><br><br><i>After a summer of deadly fights with supernatural creatures known only as &quot;Sirens,&quot; you and your friends finally have time to relax and enjoy yourselves. But in the wreckage of a job well done...it's become obvious just how fleeting their time with you actually is. Even so, it's your job to say goodbye to each of them and go to college. It's your job to be an adult.<br><br>Still, it's five of them versus one of you. And after years of friendship and an entire summer of fighting side-by-side, these people know exactly what it takes to make you want to stay home...for just a bit longer. </i><br><br>A game that's designed to make you as unsure of yourself as humanly possible, Siren's Call takes full advantage of every aspect of the visual novel format to deliver a mind-warping storytelling experience. Can you get the &quot;Hell&quot; out of Florida? Will you reach Escape Velocity?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952590/extras/01efeeb7bc87fb6bae0783453034860c.avif?t=1727853397\" width=496 height=200 /></span><br>      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952590/extras/6d9917b3455f4de3f01b5e4a8bb9ade2.avif?t=1727853397\" width=800 height=571 /></span><br>      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952590/extras/4d2035c2430e22a587047111d00df38d.avif?t=1727853397\" width=800 height=571 /></span><br>      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952590/extras/47a8a662218102075e5afa501ba032f6.avif?t=1727853397\" width=800 height=571 /></span><br>      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952590/extras/70920876cb4972119b60d4917c08fe2a.avif?t=1727853397\" width=800 height=571 /></span><br>      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952590/extras/64cc30ad293e1497f449c90f53d1a62a.avif?t=1727853397\" width=800 height=571 /></span><br>      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952590/extras/9a5e9cc120f054abce7d6925e066b0ab.avif?t=1727853397\" width=800 height=571 /></span><br>      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952590/extras/9b207549666e032dec549a35ece23aac.avif?t=1727853397\" width=800 height=571 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Inspired by games like Persona 4, Higurashi, and Doki Doki Literature Club, Siren\u2019s Call: Escape Velocity is a tropical cocktail of delicious summertime dread. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952590/extras/5e41f9fe74d82d970bedae120a762883.avif?t=1727853397\" width=496 height=191 /></span><br><br><strong><u>As a story that begins at the end, all that's standing between you and adulthood are your old party members. Your best friends.</u></strong><br><br><i>After a summer of deadly fights with supernatural creatures known only as &quot;Sirens,&quot; you and your friends finally have time to relax and enjoy yourselves. But in the wreckage of a job well done...it's become obvious just how fleeting their time with you actually is. Even so, it's your job to say goodbye to each of them and go to college. It's your job to be an adult.<br><br>Still, it's five of them versus one of you. And after years of friendship and an entire summer of fighting side-by-side, these people know exactly what it takes to make you want to stay home...for just a bit longer. </i><br><br>A game that's designed to make you as unsure of yourself as humanly possible, Siren's Call takes full advantage of every aspect of the visual novel format to deliver a mind-warping storytelling experience. Can you get the &quot;Hell&quot; out of Florida? Will you reach Escape Velocity?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952590/extras/01efeeb7bc87fb6bae0783453034860c.avif?t=1727853397\" width=496 height=200 /></span><br>      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952590/extras/6d9917b3455f4de3f01b5e4a8bb9ade2.avif?t=1727853397\" width=800 height=571 /></span><br>      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952590/extras/4d2035c2430e22a587047111d00df38d.avif?t=1727853397\" width=800 height=571 /></span><br>      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952590/extras/47a8a662218102075e5afa501ba032f6.avif?t=1727853397\" width=800 height=571 /></span><br>      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952590/extras/70920876cb4972119b60d4917c08fe2a.avif?t=1727853397\" width=800 height=571 /></span><br>      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952590/extras/64cc30ad293e1497f449c90f53d1a62a.avif?t=1727853397\" width=800 height=571 /></span><br>      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952590/extras/9a5e9cc120f054abce7d6925e066b0ab.avif?t=1727853397\" width=800 height=571 /></span><br>      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952590/extras/9b207549666e032dec549a35ece23aac.avif?t=1727853397\" width=800 height=571 /></span>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to your endless summer! Escape its influence before the town of Siren's Call erases you completely. This version of the game is a free prologue and covers the first part of this story.",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cThe early '10s-teenage-summer-beach atmosphere and the amazing soundtrack create the perfect setting for the themes of friendship, love, growing up and moving on. In general, I am a huge fan of the whole 'cute things turn scary' trope, but please understand that this game is so much more than that. I don't mean to compare, but if you're a fan of DDLC, you'll most likely enjoy Siren's Call.\u201d<br>Recommended \u2013 Zee-o<br><br>\u201cThis is, hands down, one of the best visual novel experiences I have ever been through, if not the best. You absolutely will not know what you are about to witness when you play this. Every character feels alive. You will grow to care about every one of them, especially the main character[..]Everything in this game is treated about how it should be in real life, making for a realistic experience that really sits with you.\u201d<br>Recommended \u2013 Casca<br><br>\u201cSiren\u2019s Call: Escape Velocity is a thoughtful coming-of-age story wrapped in a slow-burn mystery that artfully tackles its themes and cleverly takes advantage of the possibilities of the visual novel medium. Come for the thrill and atmosphere and stay for the heart.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Nook Gaming<br>",
